model for_hole
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247), the round's mutation run (walk/move_flows.rs for_period_of): a movement whose for is a month a window row leaves open (month_of over March's end) has that hole as its period, so flows(…, for k) is that hole; the past one (before the model's on) is listed unfulfilled, the planned one isn't (L §5.14.3, §8.2; P64)"

source s "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input w: date
input d_past: date
input d_plan: date

move past_pay: transfers
  on d_past
  for month_of(w)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

move plan_pay: transfers
  on d_plan
  for month_of(w)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w = window(2026-03-25, 2026-04-05) "s"
  d_past = 2026-04-02 "s"
  d_plan = 2026-07-02 "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask past_mar: flows(past_pay, 2026-01 .. 2026-12, for 2026-03)
ask plan_mar: flows(plan_pay, 2026-01 .. 2026-12, for 2026-03)
ask past_pinned: flows(past_pay, 2026-01 .. 2026-12, for 2026-03) with w = 2026-03-30
